{"id":260014255554670,"type":"artist","name":"Stephan Micus","artist":null,"year":1953,"weight":27,"info":{"tags":["ambient","world","World Music","world fusion","ECM"],"country":"DE","begin":"1953-01-19","kind":"Person","similar":["Anouar Brahem","Jon Balke","Codona","David Darling","Eberhard Weber","Steve Tibbetts","Jon Hassell","Djivan Gasparyan","Dhafer Youssef","William Ryan Fritch"],"img":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/artist/dc9988aa4f5ab319609c8317a769e2c5/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","bio":"Stephan Micus nació el 19 de enero de 1953 en Alemania. Es un músico multi-instrumentista, compositor e investigador musical.\n\nLa obra de Micus es principalmente del estilo world music. Su música explora las sonoridades y posibilidades expresivas de muy diferentes instrumentos de las tradiciones musicales del mundo. En muchos casos, Micus toca todos los instrumentos en sus grabaciones, combinando estilos de muy diferentes países y usando instrumentos de formas sin precedentes en cada una de sus piezas musicales."},"works":[{"id":89591348145687,"type":"album","name":"Implosions","artist":"Stephan Micus","year":1977,"weight":18,"yt":"2lt8khOvvAk","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":65232636722211,"name":"Scaruffi 1970s","rank":72,"scaruffi":8.0},{"id":173758478099223,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Avant-Folk","rank":73,"scaruffi":8.0},{"id":273501579136396,"name":"RYM Top — New Age","rank":41,"scaruffi":8.0}],"n_lists":3}},{"id":22616372913997,"type":"album","name":"Till the End of Time","artist":"Stephan Micus","year":1978,"weight":4,"yt":"kLsX0WEZ4l0","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":173758478099223,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Avant-Folk","rank":194,"scaruffi":null},{"id":273501579136396,"name":"RYM Top — New Age","rank":112,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":98556445565156,"type":"album","name":"Koan","artist":"Steph